    <a href="/guides/best-philosophy-books-for-kids">the best philosophy books for kids</a>{' '}
    for specific titles by age, and{' '}
    <a href="/guides/books-that-teach-kids-how-to-think">books that teach kids how to think</a>{' '}
    for ones focused on the skill of questioning itself rather than philosophy as a subject.
  </p>
